.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-storage-mount-remove - Remove a storage mount


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server storage-mount remove   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a storage mount

.PP
The mount key is deleted at once (the server can no longer reach the bucket; files in the bucket are kept). tr-ist-1 servers remove the unit automatically; on others run \fBremove_command\fR\&.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/servers/{id}/storage-mounts/{mid} (operationId deleteStorageMount, scope cloud_write)


